- Pirate faction relationships.
- Faction leaders and defeated bosses.
- Faction alliances and rivalries.
- Crew roles and assignments.
- Crew loyalty and morale.
- Crew health and injuries.
- Captured and voluntary crew.
- Journal entries.
- Music settings.
- Automatic journal settings.
- Ship damage and repair progress.
- Ship configuration.
- Current flag and unlocked designs.
- Unlocked dyes.
- Current cannons and hull upgrades.
- Materials, provisions, water and gold.
